app_lists.description:
{count} combined lists from phones with the HA SmartLists app:

{lists}

➕ = not connected yet, ✅ = connected. Connected lists are created here as combined lists and belong to the respective phone (devices). The app then shows the list from Home Assistant instead of its own. A list is missing? Tap “Sync SmartLists” in the app once.

